> Athlone Community Radio will be broadcasting live for 4 hours from Golden Island Shopping Centre in Athlone, the heart of Ireland, to Celebrate World Radio Day 2019. Our live broadcast will begin at 12[pm] and finish at 4[pm]. The Theme of World Radio Day is “[Dialogue], Tolerance and Peace”.
